  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'vi hu' vyene Isaka wamwitanaga Yakobo, wamudosyaga, na wamupaga ilagi'li'zyo ati', “Ku'du' wize u'toole muki'ma Mukanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaga ku' lwandi' lwa Padani-alamu ku'mwa gu'ku'yo Betueli, ise wamwa nnoko. U'katoole muki'ma mugati' na v'aniki' v'ana v'amwa mamiyo Labani, mudu'gu' wamwa nnoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu aku'dosye, aku'v'ezye u'v'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi na akwingi'hye muno, ki'gele u'v'e mbuto ya makabi'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu aku'dosye ev'e haki'mo na v'av'yalwa v'ako, aku'pe lu'v'ango lwamwa Abalahamu. U'yi'sole na ku'yi'tema nsi' yeni'yi' i'yi' wikalile ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi, nsi' i'yi' Mulungu wamupile Abalahamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Isaka wamudahyaga Yakobo, nawe walondaga ku' Padani-alamu ku'mwa mamiye Labani, mwana wamwa Betueli, Mualamu, ilu'mbu'ye na Lebeka, nnina wamwa Yakobo na Esau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esau ali'toola muki'ma wa wu'datu'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Esau wamanyaga ku'v'a Isaka wamudosyaga Yakobo na wamutu'maga ku'ya ku' Padani-alamu, ki'gele akatoole kwenu'ko, hangi' aho wali' ali'mudosya wamupaga ilagi'li'zyo ku'du' ize atoole mwaniki' Mukanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wamanyaga ku'v'a Yakobo wav'aku'zyaga ise na nnina, nawe wayaga ku' Padani-alamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, Esau wamanyaga ku'v'a ise Isaka akatogeziwa na v'aniki' v'a Ki'kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo Esau wayaga ku'mwa Isumaili, mwana wamwa Abalahamu, watoolaga muki'ma yu'ngi' mwana wamwa Isumaili, lina lyakwe Mahalati, ilu'mbu'ye na Nebayoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndoti yamwa Yakobo ku' Beteli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Yakobo aho wawu'kaga ku' Beeli-sheba ku' lu'go lwav'o, walondaga ku' kaya ya Halani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wafikaga lwandi' lu'mo, wawonaga alale henanho ku'nguno lyu'v'a lyasangwa lyalokaga. Wasolaga iwe li'mo lya henanho wali'sagami'laga na ku'lala tu'lo henanho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lya ku'lala kwakwe walotaga ndoti. Lingaga! Wawonaga itandi'zyo li'ki'ndi'kilwe ku'fuma ha nsi', na nsoto yakwe yi'fikile ku' ilunde. Lingaga! Hangi' v'amalaika v'a Mulungu v'ali'liina na ku'sooka ku' itandi'zyo lyeni'lo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kasinaga! Gu'ku' Mulungu wi'maga ha igu'lya na itandi'zyo, wayombaga, “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa gu'ku'yo Abalahamu, na Mulungu wamwa Isaka. Nsi' i'yi' u'lali'lile nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'yalwa v'ako ndav'ingi'hye ki'ti' lu'wuwu lwa nsi', nav'o v'alasambale ku' ki'la lwandi': ku' mweli, ku' ki'ya, ku' sukuma na ku' dakama. Ku'v'i'ti'la ku' wako magongo gose ga mu welelo galadosiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingaga, ene ni' haki'mo nanho, ndaku'su'nge ki'la u'ko u'lakaye, nanne ndaku'su'v'ye hangi' mu nsi' yeni'yi'. Nkasye nku'leke, sumbwa ndaku'gelani'zi'zye gose ago nayombile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yakobo watunu'laga, wayombaga ati', “Nhana Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' henanha, nanne nali' nkamanya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wogohaga, na wayombaga, “Henanha hatuntumu ki'ti' ki'! I'vi nu'wona henanha yi'li' nnumba ya Mulungu, na wingi'li'lo wa ku' ilunde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wangalu'ke ndiyu' Yakobo watunu'laga, wali'solaga iwe i'lo wav'age asagami'lile, wali'ki'ndi'kaga wi'i'ma ki'ti' nhi'ngi' na ku'li'v'ezya isondo ku' ku'liti'li'la maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwandi' lwenu'lo wahitanaga “Beteli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Beteli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “nnumba yamwa Mulungu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” ali'vi kaya yeni'yo ha kale hitanagwe Luzu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo watu'u'laga hangi' ki'lu'mbo ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, u'lu' u'ku'v'a haki'mo nanne, na ku'nsu'nga ku' musi'nzo gwanne, na ku'mpa viliwa na vizwalo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ku'su'v'a na ku'hola ku' lu'go lwamwa v'av'a, hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu, u'ku'v'a Mulungu wanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalyo iwe i'li' naki'ndi'kaga henanha ki'ti' nhi'ngi', yi'ku'v'a nnumba yako, ev'e Mulungu, na ku' ki'la i'cho u'lampe, nhana ndaku'fumi'zye ifungu lya iku'mi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
